        <item>
            <title>0.6.63</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 11:02:59 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/tag/v0.6.63</link>
            <sparkle:version>96</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.63</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.63

- Replace the listening orb with Silk Stream: nine flowing Templeton-green strands driven by the actual microphone level.
- Smoothly grow the waves during speech and settle to gentle motion during pauses, with a distinct processing state.
- Respect Reduce Motion and stop the flow when the listening display is dismissed. Existing Voice Orb preferences now select Silk Stream.

This visual update does not resolve the separately reported sustained Zoom meeting performance issue.
]]></description>
